      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components/package.json</file>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.AI.Widgets/tsconfig.json</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="peer-package-boundary" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components/tsconfig.json">The `baseUrl: "."` + `paths` mapping of `@spaarke/ui-components` / `@spaarke/ui-components/*` to `../Spaarke.UI.Components/dist/...` — the exact shape to replicate in `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/tsconfig.json`.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Declare rigor level per CLAUDE.md §8; load ADR-012, ADR-021, spec.md, CLAUDE.md, SHARED-UI-COMPONENTS-GUIDE.md.</step>
    <step order="1">Grep `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/` for `Spaarke.UI.Components/src` to confirm the exact set of relative-path imports before editing (expect: 1 in `types/kanban.ts`, 2 in `widgets/SmartTodoWidget/SmartTodoWidget.tsx`, 1 in `components/SmartTodoKanban/SmartTodoKanban.tsx`).</step>
    <step order="2">In `types/kanban.ts`, rewrite the `IKanbanColumn`/`KanbanOrientation` re-export from `'../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/Kanban/types'` to `'@spaarke/ui-components/components/Kanban/types'` (or the equivalent subpath the package's `dist/` build actually exposes — verify against `Spaarke.UI.Components/package.json`'s `exports`/`files` before finalizing the exact subpath).</step>
    <step order="3">In `widgets/SmartTodoWidget/SmartTodoWidget.tsx`, rewrite both imports (`OrientationToggle` from `'../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/OrientationToggle'` and `MicrosoftToDoIcon` from `'../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/icons/MicrosoftToDoIcon'`) to `@spaarke/ui-components/...` package specifiers.</step>
    <step order="4">In `components/SmartTodoKanban/SmartTodoKanban.tsx`, rewrite the `KanbanBoard` import from `'../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/Kanban/KanbanBoard'` to `@spaarke/ui-components/...`.</step>
    <step order="5">Update `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/package.json`: add `"@spaarke/ui-components": "file:../Spaarke.UI.Components"` under `dependencies`, and add `"@spaarke/ui-components": "*"` under `peerDependencies` (mirror `Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components/package.json`'s exact shape).</step>
    <step order="6">Update `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/tsconfig.json`: add `"baseUrl": "."` and a `"paths"` block mapping `@spaarke/ui-components` → `["../Spaarke.UI.Components/dist/index.d.ts"]` and `@spaarke/ui-components/*` → `["../Spaarke.UI.Components/dist/*"]` (copy verbatim from `Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components/tsconfig.json`).</step>
    <step order="7">Run `npm run build` (or `tsc --noEmit`) inside `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components`; confirm zero errors and specifically zero errors originating from `Spaarke.UI.Components`' private `src/` files.</step>
    <step order="8">Grep the whole package tree again to confirm zero remaining `Spaarke.UI.Components/src` matches.</step>
    <step order="9">Run any existing tests in `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/__tests__/` to confirm no behavioral regression from the import rewrite.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `projects/smart-todo-r5/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: mark 001 status 🔲 → ✅.</step>
    <step order="11">Document any deviation (e.g., a different subpath than assumed) in `projects/smart-todo-r5/notes/`.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the `Spaarke.AI.Widgets` / `Spaarke.DailyBriefing.Components` tsconfig `paths` pattern differs materially from what PR #508 (per its title/description) assumed — e.g., if `Spaarke.UI.Components/dist/` does not actually expose the subpaths these imports need — STOP and reconcile before proceeding; do not invent a third resolution strategy without documenting why the two existing precedents don't apply.</trigger>
  </escalation>

